{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"exceedable-enervated-galago","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\norigin/main HEAD trips the C901 complexity ratchet added by c9f7 (scripts/check_complexity_baseline.py --check reports increased=1, so make lint exits non-zero). Root cause: commit aec1 (ff4c5600) raised src/rebar/llm/runner.py::PydanticAIRunner.run cyclomatic complexity from its baseline ceiling 24 to 25 via a success-path run-shape try/except. aec1 merged before c9f7, but c9f7's Verified gate ran on a pre-aec1 patchset; Gerrit's submit-time rebase stacked the gate on aec1 without re-verifying (ADR-0047 rebase-without-reverify hazard). A pre-existing failure of our quality ratchets on current origin/main; must be resolved before the epic's ratchet stories can close.\n\n## Approach\nExtract aec1's success-path shape-capture try/except (usage_log.run_shape + shape_only + telemetry-safe except) out of PydanticAIRunner.run into a small module-level helper that mutates the usage dict in place. Behavior-preserving; removes one try + one except branch from run, bringing its C901 back to <=24. No baseline regeneration; shrink-only invariant restored, not conceded.\n\n## Scope\n- src/rebar/llm/runner.py\n\n## Testing / Verification\n- python3 scripts/check_complexity_baseline.py --check exits 0\n- make lint exits 0 on current origin/main\n- existing llm runner / usage-log success-path tests pass\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] PydanticAIRunner.run C901 complexity <= committed baseline ceiling (24)\n- [ ] Extracted helper preserves behavior: on success usage dict gains shape_only keys; run_shape/shape_only exception swallowed with same warning log\n- [ ] python3 scripts/check_complexity_baseline.py --check exits 0 against current origin/main (increased=0, new=0, stale=0)\n- [ ] make lint exits 0 against current origin/main\n- [ ] Relevant existing llm runner / usage-log success-path tests pass","id":"bd4c-78be-c37c-4ad0","parent_id":"c9f7-d6df-bce0-4b77","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"story","title":"Restore C901 ratchet green on origin/main: extract runner run-shape capture"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785965327387614001,"uuid":"e64180b1-c27e-47de-874d-d0d745fcbb89"}